             10 COM-SALIDA        PIC X(3000)  VALUE SPACES.
             10 FILLER            PIC X VALUE X'00'.
          05 COM-LONG-P.
             10 COM-LONG          PIC X(04) VALUE SPACES.
             10 FILLER            PIC X VALUE X'00'.
          05 COM-OPCION-P.
             10 COM-OPCION        PIC X(50) VALUE SPACES.
             10 FILLER            PIC X VALUE X'00'.
          05 COM-CLAVES-P1.
             10 COM-CLAVE-1       PIC X(150) VALUE SPACES.
             10 FILLER            PIC X VALUE X'00'.
          05 COM-CLAVES-P2.
             10 COM-CLAVE-2       PIC X(150) VALUE SPACES.
             10 FILLER            PIC X VALUE X'00'.
          05 COM-TIMEOUT-P.
